From ffd8952e3b0e43c8382a5282b542ea27a6c19ffe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Lothian <mike@fireburn.co.uk>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 23:10:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 08/13] revdi: keep production comments in sync with the kernel

Refresh the generated EVDI source after replacing the dated bandwidth investigation note with the invariant required by mode validation.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-0
Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-5
Signed-off-by: Mike Lothian <mike@fireburn.co.uk>
---
